---
import Layout from '@layouts/Layout.astro';
const title = '中国免签国家名单（2026年）— China Starter Guide';
const description = '查看您的国家是否符合2026年中国免签政策。';
---

<Layout title={title} description={description} lang="zh">
  <article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto py-12">
    <!-- Header -->
    <header class="mb-12">
      <a href="/zh/prepare/visa/" class="text-sm text-brand-600 hover:underline inline-flex items-center gap-1 mb-4">← 签证与入境</a>
      <div class="text-sm text-brand-600 font-medium tracking-wide uppercase mb-3">签证与入境</div>
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-gray-900 leading-tight mb-4">
        中国免签国家名单（2026年）
      </h1>
      <p class="text-lg text-gray-400">
        想知道去中国是否需要签证吗？
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="prose prose-gray max-w-none">
      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">
        请查看以下名单。如果您的国家属于中国免签政策范围，您无需提前申请旅游签证即可入境中国——每次入境最长可停留30天。
      </p>

      <hr class="my-10 border-gray-200" />

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">哪些人可以免签入境中国？</h2>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">
        持有以下国家普通护照的公民，可免签入境中国，用于：
      </p>

      <div class="bg-gray-50 border border-gray-100 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-8 not-prose">
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1 text-gray-700 m-0">
          <li>旅游</li>
          <li>商务访问</li>
          <li>探亲</li>
          <li>短期文化交流</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="text-gray-700 mt-4 mb-0 font-medium">
          最长停留时间：每次入境不超过30个日历日。
        </p>
      </div>

      <hr class="my-10 border-gray-200" />

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">欧洲（40个国家）</h2>

      <div class="bg-gray-50 border border-gray-100 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-8 not-prose">
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-3 font-medium">仅限普通护照持有人</p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
          <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-white rounded-lg text-sm text-gray-700 border border-gray-200">阿尔巴尼亚</span>
          <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-white rounded-lg text-sm text-gray-700 border border-gray-200">奥地利</span>
          <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-white rounded-lg text-sm text-gray-700 border border-gray-200">比利时</span>
          <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-white rounded-lg text-sm text-gray-700 border border-gray-200">波斯尼亚和黑塞哥维那</span>
          <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-white rounded-lg text-sm text-gray-700 border border-gray-200">保加利亚</span>
          <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-white rounded-lg text-sm text-gray-700 border border-gray-200">克罗地亚</span>
          <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-white rounded-lg text-sm text-gray-700 border border-gray-200">塞浦路斯</span>
          <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-white rounded-lg text-sm text-gray-700 border border-gray-200">捷克共和国</span>
          <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-white rounded-lg text-sm text-gray-700 border border-gray-200">丹麦</span>
          <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-white rounded-lg text-sm text-gray-700 border border-gray-200">爱沙尼亚</span>
          <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-white rounded-lg text-sm text-gray-700 border border-gray-200">芬兰</span>
          <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-white rounded-lg text-sm text-gray-700 border border-gray-200">法国</span>
          <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-white rounded-lg text-sm text-gray-700 border border-gray-200">德国</span>
          <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-white rounded-lg text-sm text-gray-700 border border-gray-200">希腊</span>
          <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-white rounded-lg text-sm text-gray-700 border border-gray-200">匈牙利</span>
          <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-white rounded-lg text-sm text-gray-700 border border-gray-200">冰岛</span>
          <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-white rounded-lg text-sm text-gray-700 border border-gray-200">爱尔兰</span>
          <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-white rounded-lg text-sm text-gray-700 border border-gray-200">意大利</span>
          <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-white rounded-lg text-sm text-gray-700 border border-gray-200">拉脱维亚</span>
          <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-white rounded-lg text-sm text-gray-700 border border-gray-200">列支敦士登</span>
          <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-white rounded-lg text-sm text-gray-700 border border-gray-200">立陶宛</span>
          <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-white rounded-lg text-sm text-gray-700 border border-gray-200">卢森堡</span>
          <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-white rounded-lg text-sm text-gray-700 border border-gray-200">马耳他</span>
          <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-white rounded-lg text-sm text-gray-700 border border-gray-200">摩纳哥</span>
          <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-white rounded-lg text-sm text-gray-700 border border-gray-200">黑山</span>
          <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-white rounded-lg text-sm text-gray-700 border border-gray-200">荷兰</span>
          <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-white rounded-lg text-sm text-gray-700 border border-gray-200">北马其顿</span>
          <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-white rounded-lg text-sm text-gray-700 border border-gray-200">挪威</span>
          <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-white rounded-lg text-sm text-gray-700 border border-gray-200">波兰</span>
          <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-white rounded-lg text-sm text-gray-700 border border-gray-200">葡萄牙</span>
          <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-white rounded-lg text-sm text-gray-700 border border-gray-200">罗马尼亚</span>
          <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-white rounded-lg text-sm text-gray-700 border border-gray-200">俄罗斯</span>
          <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-white rounded-lg text-sm text-gray-700 border border-gray-200">塞尔维亚</span>
          <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-white rounded-lg text-sm text-gray-700 border border-gray-200">斯洛伐克</span>
          <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-white rounded-lg text-sm text-gray-700 border border-gray-200">斯洛文尼亚</span>
          <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-white rounded-lg text-sm text-gray-700 border border-gray-200">西班牙</span>
          <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-white rounded-lg text-sm text-gray-700 border border-gray-200">瑞典</span>
          <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-white rounded-lg text-sm text-gray-700 border border-gray-200">瑞士</span>
          <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-white rounded-lg text-sm text-gray-700 border border-gray-200">乌克兰</span>
          <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-white rounded-lg text-sm text-gray-700 border border-gray-200">英国</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">北美（1个国家）</h2>

      <div class="bg-gray-50 border border-gray-100 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-8 not-prose">
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
          <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-white rounded-lg text-sm text-gray-700 border border-gray-200">加拿大</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">大洋洲（2个国家）</h2>

      <div class="bg-gray-50 border border-gray-100 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-8 not-prose">
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
          <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-white rounded-lg text-sm text-gray-700 border border-gray-200">澳大利亚</span>
          <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-white rounded-lg text-sm text-gray-700 border border-gray-200">新西兰</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">亚洲（9个国家）</h2>

      <div class="bg-gray-50 border border-gray-100 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-8 not-prose">
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
          <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-white rounded-lg text-sm text-gray-700 border border-gray-200">巴林</span>
          <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-white rounded-lg text-sm text-gray-700 border border-gray-200">文莱</span>
          <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-white rounded-lg text-sm text-gray-700 border border-gray-200">日本</span>
          <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-white rounded-lg text-sm text-gray-700 border border-gray-200">科威特</span>
          <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-white rounded-lg text-sm text-gray-700 border border-gray-200">马来西亚*</span>
          <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-white rounded-lg text-sm text-gray-700 border border-gray-200">阿曼</span>
          <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-white rounded-lg text-sm text-gray-700 border border-gray-200">卡塔尔</span>
          <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-white rounded-lg text-sm text-gray-700 border border-gray-200">沙特阿拉伯</span>
          <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-white rounded-lg text-sm text-gray-700 border border-gray-200">新加坡*</span>
          <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-white rounded-lg text-sm text-gray-700 border border-gray-200">韩国</span>
          <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-white rounded-lg text-sm text-gray-700 border border-gray-200">阿拉伯联合酋长国</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-4 mb-0">*新加坡和马来西亚：每次停留不得超过30天，且在任何180天内累计停留不得超过90天。</p>
      </div>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">南美洲（3个国家）</h2>

      <div class="bg-gray-50 border border-gray-100 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-8 not-prose">
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
          <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-white rounded-lg text-sm text-gray-700 border border-gray-200">阿根廷</span>
          <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-white rounded-lg text-sm text-gray-700 border border-gray-200">巴西</span>
          <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-white rounded-lg text-sm text-gray-700 border border-gray-200">智利</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <hr class="my-10 border-gray-200" />

      <div class="bg-brand-50 border-l-2 border-brand-300 pl-5 py-3 my-8 not-prose">
        <p class="text-gray-600 m-0 italic text-sm">
          <strong>注意：</strong>政策可能发生变化。出行前请务必通过官方政府渠道或就近的中国大使馆/领事馆确认。
        </p>
      </div>

      <hr class="my-10 border-gray-200" />

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">可以停留多久？</h2>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-2">
        <strong>简单回答：</strong>每次访问最长30个日历日。
      </p>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">
        <strong>计算方式：</strong>自抵达次日午夜开始计算。
      </p>

      <hr class="my-10 border-gray-200" />

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">免签入境需要什么？</h2>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">
        即使免签，您仍需准备：
      </p>

      <div class="space-y-4 mb-8 not-prose">
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 bg-gray-50 rounded-xl border border-gray-100">
          <span class="flex-shrink-0 w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-brand-100 text-brand-700 text-sm flex items-center justify-center font-bold">✅</span>
          <div>
            <p class="font-medium text-gray-900 m-0">有效护照</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 m-0">剩余有效期需超过6个月</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 bg-gray-50 rounded-xl border border-gray-100">
          <span class="flex-shrink-0 w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-brand-100 text-brand-700 text-sm flex items-center justify-center font-bold">✅</span>
          <div>
            <p class="font-medium text-gray-900 m-0">续程或返程证明</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 m-0">机票或行程单（如被要求）</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 bg-gray-50 rounded-xl border border-gray-100">
          <span class="flex-shrink-0 w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-brand-100 text-brand-700 text-sm flex items-center justify-center font-bold">✅</span>
          <div>
            <p class="font-medium text-gray-900 m-0">住宿信息</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 m-0">酒店预订凭证或住宿地址（如被要求）</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 bg-gray-50 rounded-xl border border-gray-100">
          <span class="flex-shrink-0 w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-brand-100 text-brand-700 text-sm flex items-center justify-center font-bold">✅</span>
          <div>
            <p class="font-medium text-gray-900 m-0">合法入境目的证明</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 m-0">证明您的行程属于旅游、商务、探亲或文化交流</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <p class="text-gray-700 mb-6 italic">
        <strong>温馨提示：</strong>边检人员可能会要求查验这些文件，请务必随身携带。
      </p>

      <hr class="my-10 border-gray-200" />

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">如果您的国家不在名单上怎么办？</h2>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">
        别担心——您可能仍有其他选择：
      </p>

      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mb-8 not-prose">
        <a href="/zh/prepare/visa/visa-guide/" class="block p-5 bg-gray-50 border border-gray-100 rounded-2xl hover:border-brand-200 hover:shadow-sm transition-all">
          <p class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-1">方案1：240小时免签过境政策</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 m-0">适用于过境前往第三国或地区</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/zh/prepare/visa/visa-guide/" class="block p-5 bg-gray-50 border border-gray-100 rounded-2xl hover:border-brand-200 hover:shadow-sm transition-all">
          <p class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-1">方案2：中国旅游签证（L类）</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 m-0">标准签证申请流程</p>
        </a>
      </div>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">
        想了解更多？请查看：
      </p>

      <div class="space-y-2 mb-8 not-prose">
        <a href="/zh/prepare/visa/visa-guide/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-sm text-brand-600 font-medium hover:underline">2026年办理中国签证有多容易？ →</a><br/>
        <a href="#" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-sm text-brand-600 font-medium hover:underline">中国240小时免签过境政策详解 →</a><br/>
        <a href="#" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-sm text-brand-600 font-medium hover:underline">如何申请中国旅游签证 →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
